<title>NIGERIA: Mobil Nigeria full-yr profit dips.</title>
<headline>Mobil Nigeria full-yr profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for petroleum products marketing company Mobil Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated.</p>
<p>				    1996	1996</p>
<p> Turnover		     11,500     11,900</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    1,200	1,800</p>
<p> Taxation			317.3	  582</p>
<p> Profit after taxation     933.7	1,200</p>
<p>Dividend - The company is proposing a final dividend of 2.30 naira per share. It earlier paid 3.00 naira as interim dividend. Total dividend for 1995 was 8.35 naira.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
